<title>USA: IPO FILING - Flagstar Bancorp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Flagstar Bancorp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  Flagstar Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p> Stock symbol			   FLGS.O</p>
<p> Estimated price range		     N/A</p>
<p> Total shares to be offered   8.05 Million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by company	 2.2 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by shareholders 5.85 million</p>
<p> Shrs outstanding after IPO     13,450,000</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter	    Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  330,000 shrs from company, 877,500 shrs from selling shareholders.</p>
<p>Business: (A thrift holding company based in Bloomfield Hills, Mich., it ranks among the largest U.S. originators of conforming single-family mortgage loans.)</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: General corporate purposes, additional capital to its bank to retain more servicing rights and to expand operations through acquisitions or new branches.</p>
<p> Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Interest Income	$71,304	    $35,112</p>
<p>   - Net Earnings	   $15,476	    $16 131</p>
